sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant GSL as GrindSessionLive
    participant Helpers as breakClockHelpers
    participant Popup as BreakFeedbackPopup
    participant API as userSettingsAPI<br/>(PATCH /api/user-settings)

    Note over User, API: Fluxo 1 — Toggle ON click + persist (otimista + rollback)
    User->>GSL: clica Switch Auto-Break (OFF -> ON)
    GSL->>GSL: setQueryData(userAlertSettings, { breakAutoOpenEnabled: true })
    GSL->>API: PATCH { breakAutoOpenEnabled: true }
    alt sucesso
        API-->>GSL: 200 { breakAutoOpenEnabled: true }
        GSL-->>User: toggle permanece ON (silencio)
    else falha
        API-->>GSL: 4xx/5xx
        GSL->>GSL: rollback setQueryData(prev)
        GSL-->>User: toast erro + toggle volta OFF
    end

    Note over User, API: Fluxo 2 — Auto-open em XX:54 BRT (interval 30s)
    loop a cada 30s (useEffect dedicado, guard breakAutoOpenEnabled === true)
        GSL->>Helpers: getBrtMinute(now)
        Helpers-->>GSL: minute (0..59)
        GSL->>Helpers: getCurrentHourKey(now)
        Helpers-->>GSL: "YYYY-MM-DD-HH" (BRT)
        GSL->>Helpers: shouldAutoOpenAtClock(now, lastTriggerHourKey.current)
        Helpers-->>GSL: boolean
        alt minute === 54 AND key !== lastTriggerHourKey AND !isPaused AND !skipBreaksToday AND !showBreakDialog
            GSL->>GSL: lastTriggerHourKey.current = currentHourKey
            GSL->>GSL: wasAutoOpened.current = true
            GSL->>GSL: setShowBreakDialog(true)
            GSL->>GSL: setShowBreakBanner(false)<br/>setBreakBannerActive(false)<br/>(suprime banner FP-07 da hora)
            GSL->>Popup: render (open=true, onSliderInteraction)
            Popup-->>User: modal aberto
        else condicao nao atendida
            GSL-->>GSL: skip (no-op)
        end
    end

    Note over User, API: Fluxo 3 — Auto-close em XX:02 BRT com guards
    loop a cada 30s (mesmo interval do Fluxo 2)
        GSL->>Helpers: shouldAutoCloseAtClock(now, openedAt)
        Helpers-->>GSL: boolean (true em janela [XX:02, XX:06))
        alt true AND wasAutoOpened.current === true
            GSL->>Helpers: isInteractingWithModal(lastSliderInteractionAt.current, isInTextarea)
            Helpers-->>GSL: boolean
            alt user interagindo (slider <30s OR textarea focused)
                GSL-->>GSL: skip close, retentar proximo tick
                Note right of GSL: ate forcar em XX:06 (4 min apos)
            else nao esta interagindo
                GSL->>GSL: setShowBreakDialog(false)
                GSL->>GSL: wasAutoOpened.current = false
                GSL->>Popup: unmount (open=false)
                GSL-->>User: toast "Break finalizado.<br/>Voce pode registrar manualmente em Gerenciar Breaks."
            end
        else fora da janela OR aberto manualmente
            GSL-->>GSL: skip (nao auto-fecha modal manual)
        end
    end

    Note over User, API: Fluxo 4 — "Pular Todos os Breaks Hoje" -> persiste OFF
    User->>Popup: clica "Pular Todos os Breaks Hoje"
    Popup->>GSL: callback onSkipAllToday()
    GSL->>GSL: setSkipBreaksToday(true)<br/>setShowBreakDialog(false)<br/>wasAutoOpened.current = false
    GSL->>GSL: setQueryData(userAlertSettings, { breakAutoOpenEnabled: false })<br/>(toggle UI vira OFF otimista)
    GSL->>API: PATCH { breakAutoOpenEnabled: false }
    alt sucesso
        API-->>GSL: 200 { breakAutoOpenEnabled: false }
        GSL-->>User: toast "Auto-Break desativado. Reative quando quiser via toggle."
    else falha
        API-->>GSL: 4xx/5xx
        GSL->>GSL: rollback setQueryData(prev)
        GSL-->>User: toast erro + toggle volta ON
    end
